				&lt;span style="font-family:'MS Reference Sans Serif'"&gt;13. Effective July 30, 2025, Kellar, Kevin was named as Vice President of State Finance &amp;amp; Regulatory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'MS Reference Sans Serif'"&gt;Effective October 9, 2025, Brackney, Brian was named as Vice President of Ohio Operations.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
