    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHE248438F513BDF5F196CAFACBA6AE8F4" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Individual line data is not provided for the 345kV, 138kV and 69kV lines as Toledo Edison Company does not maintain or operate these lines. Toledo Edison Company leases the land and land rights used for the 69kV and above lines in its territory to American Transmission Systems, Inc. who owns and operates the lines.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
