              <td style="width: 489.7pt; border: dashed #BBBBBB 1.0pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 24.95pt;" colspan="6" rowspan="4" width="653">
                <p class="MsoNormal">
                  <span style="color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;">Pursuant to order at CASE NO. 24-1097-EL-AIS dated 4/16/2025, The Toledo Edison Company received authorization to issue long-term debt in the amount of $125,000,000. To date $100,000,000 has been issued, with authorization to issue additional long-term debt in the amount of $25,000,000 remaining. Authorization expires on 4/15/2026.</span>
                </p>
              </td>
              <td style="width: 1.0pt; border: none; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 24.95pt;" width="1">&#160;</td>
            </tr>
